<title>CHINA: TENNIS-CHINA BEAT UZBEKISTAN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHINA BEAT UZBEKISTAN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China completed a 4-1 victory over</p>
<p>Uzbekistan in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one, first</p>
<p>round tie after winning both reverse singles on Thursday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Xia Jiaping beat Oleg Ogorodov 6-4 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7)</p>
<p>Pan Bing beat Dmitry Tomashevich 6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>China now meet Japan or South Korea on April 4 to 6 for a</p>
<p>place in the qualifying tournament for the world group.</p>
</text>
